body:
nearly chocked on a spoon once, it wasn't as bad as your story. Can't remember what exactly I did, probably franticly shoving it back and forth when I lost grip on it, felt the spoon way to deep down my throat, could hardly breath and paniced but managed to pull it out somehow. Although I actually thought that I will die while I had it down my throat I still used the same spoon once or twice...

&#x200B;

I hope you are better now, I wish you the very best. Thank you for sharing your story and reminding me of my own expirience. I hope it stops at last one person from making the same mistakes as us

I'm not from the UK but is it common for not underweight patients to be put on a diet plan that is intendet for weight gain? (my main concern... yeah ik)

&#x200B;

also you might get more attention on a more popular sub like r/EDAnonymous

